# ===== 罗网 Dragnet =====
# 原则：仅上传最小项目内容，开发期间产生的文档、截图、临时产物一律不入库

# --- 开发期间产生的文档与截图 ---
*.doc
*.docx
*.pdf
*.xlsx
*.pptx
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.bmp
*.webp
!docs/**/*.png
docs/notes/
notes/
scratch/
设计文档/
需求文档/

# --- 系统与工具 ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- 依赖与构建产物 ---
node_modules/
dist/
build/
out/
target/
*.o
*.obj
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.apk
*.hap
*.app

# --- 日志与缓存 ---
*.log
logs/
.cache/
.tmp/
tmp/

# --- IDE / 编辑器 ---
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml

# --- 敏感信息 ---
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
credentials.*
secret.*
